+"""Verified generator for iterated abelian-map Yang--Baxter preimages.
+
+The family uses Example 4.1, Proposition 5.1, and Corollary 5.4 of
+arXiv:2007.08967.  A source pair is sampled first and mapped forward, so the
+certificate is known by inverse generation.  All arithmetic is exact in a
+prime field; the module is deterministic in ``(n, seed, params)`` and silent
+on import.
+"""
+
+from __future__ import annotations
