The paper’s Corollary 5.4(3) explicitly provides \(R_2=R_1^{-1}\), ruling out Track A. A Track B preimage family was built and tested:

- Mechanical route: 7,200,117 field operations.
- Compact invariant route: 105 operations.
- Bare oracle run: 0/3 solved.
- Structurally hinted run: solved at the initial setting and again after the one permitted escalation.

This terminally fails G9(b). Other native tasks are direct formulas, classifications, or lack a scalable bounded certificate. These conclusions follow from the [full paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2007.08967).

